🛠️ Key Components
BioNeMo Framework: A containerized library (available via NVIDIA NGC) that provides pre-built pipelines for models like MegaMolBART (chemistry) and OpenFold (structure).
NIM (NVIDIA Inference Microservices): For production, NVIDIA recommends BioNeMo NIMs which provide simple API endpoints for structural prediction and docking without needing to manage the underlying model code.
Recipes: BioNeMo uses "recipes"—standardized scripts and configs—to quickly start fine-tuning models on your own datasets. 
